            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christopher Noel Jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I tried this recipe for the first time and have to admit, it is delicious and refreshing indeed. I used Perrier Sparkling L'Orange instead of Club Soda. I would also skip the Bitters. Perfection!!!!!",
